# Base URL the dashboard uses to reach the dP Relay v5 API.
# STAGE F12 (production): the API is a SUBDOMAIN of the same registrable
# domain as the dashboard — `app.dprelay.digital-papyrus.com` (this SPA) and
# `api.dprelay.digital-papyrus.com` (API) — so the session cookie set by the
# API is same-site with the page that reads it. Do NOT point this at the
# onrender.com origin: that is a different site (and a PSL entry), so a
# SameSite=Lax cookie would never be sent and login would silently break.
VITE_API_BASE=https://api.dprelay.digital-papyrus.com
# Empty = same origin (API reverse-proxied in front of the static site).
# Only use that when a proxy really exists on this origin — there is none on
# the production static site, and /v5/* returns 404 there.
# Baked into the bundle at BUILD time (Vite) — rebuild to change it.
# Note: a cross-origin value requires the static site's origin to be listed in
# the API's CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS (Render env) — `https://app.dprelay.digital-papyrus.com`
# is already on that allow-list.
